    "description": "Staff Engineer at  Sun Microsystems\n   Solaris Storage Software\n   - Led the team for Solaris SAS HBA management project through T11 Storage Management HBA. standard(ANSI INCITS 428:2007).  Defined properties and events at   HBA driver layer to support the standard APIs.  Identified interoperability issues on the standard and submitted resolutions through T11 amendments  T11/09-603.\n\n   - Led the team for Solaris iSNS(inernet Storage Name Service) project which \n   provides for IP SAN discovery service through IETF4171 protocol.    \n   - Techincal lead for Solaris10 Update2 Network Storage Consolidation release. \n       Responsible for coordinating cross-group deliveries, resolving technical\n       issues prior to integration to Solaris and providing TOI to the service group.\n    -  Developed  ANSI standard Multipath Management API and \n       posted  implementation at sourceforge.net.\n    -  Developed and T11 specification FC HBA library for Solaris InfiniBand driver \n       stack to support IB Fibre Channel TCA.  \n    -  Sun Network Storage liaison for FC consortium.  \n       Administered and analyzed FC compliance test on Solaris driver stack and \n       Fibre Channel HBA products.\n    -  Developed various test suite including SCSI-3 PGR and tape ioctl.",
